msgstr "With your {campo}° field (less than 0.6°) you need the <b>D80</b> catalog (1.2 GB), which only exists as a Windows installer: download it on the PC from <a href=\"{web}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hnsky.org</a> and install it in the ASTAP folder. D50 may do if the field isn't much smaller."

